    "sourceCode": "Employer Portal",
    "title": "Software Engineer",
    "description": "<p>Job Description & Requirements</p><p><strong>Job Responsibilities:</strong></p><ol><li><p>Responsible for overseas Android application development and providing technical support to overseas clients.</p></li><li><p>Interpret and implement technical specifications in accordance with local regulatory and compliance requirements of customers, ensuring successful delivery.</p></li></ol><p><strong>Job Requirements:</strong></p><ol><li><p>Bachelor\u2019s degree or above, with more than 5 years of Android development experience; participation in multiple end-to-end project developments.</p></li><li><p>Proficient in Java/Kotlin; solid understanding and hands-on experience with Android components and mechanisms, and in-depth knowledge of Android application build processes.</p></li><li><p>Keeps up with emerging technologies and new solutions in the financial industry, with a strong ability to explore and innovate.</p></li><li><p>Strong communication skills, with the ability to work independently and analyze and resolve problems effectively.</p></li><li><p>Experience in POS device development is a plus; strong English listening, speaking, reading, and writing skills are preferred.<br /></p><p>Jackie Hu R1102064<br />Hansing Recruitment Pte Ltd 23C1646</p></li></ol>",
